OL,3,GNEWSACrumbling concrete car park will
OL,4,Aclose permanently
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car park in Northampton town centre,
OL,7,Fwhich closed suddenly after crumbling
OL,8,Fconcrete was found in the structure,
OL,9,Fwill now shut permanently.
OL,11,FMayorhold Car Park in Lady's Lane was
OL,12,Fbuilt more than 50 years ago and was
OL,13,Fdue to be demolished next year as part
OL,14,Fof the wider Greyfriars regeneration
OL,15,Fprogramme.
OL,17,FWest Northamptonshire Council shut the
OL,18,Fcar park in July and said it would
OL,19,Frequire extensive repairs to enable it
OL,20,Fto reopen safely. This closure has now
OL,21,Fbeen made permanent.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
