OL,3,GNEWSACrumbling concrete car park will
OL,4,Aclose permanently
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Slope, cabinet member for finance,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We recognise this news will come
OL,8,Fas a disappointment to regular users of
OL,9,FMayorhold Car Park and neighbouring
OL,10,Fbusinesses, but the safety of car park
OL,11,Fusers always comes first."
